<title>USA: Tradelink Intl sets reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Tradelink Intl sets reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>TradeLink International Inc said Wednesday that every five shares of its outstanding common stock will be exchanged for one new share of common stock, effective as of the close of business Wednesday.</p>
<p>The one-for-five reverse split will decrease the number of shares outstanding from about 30 million to about 6 million, Tradelink said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
